Z||000003||Richard Parnell||02-07-2001||06:42 PM||||What type of stuff did you do to glass the cowl to the hood?  Just regular old fiberglassing or do you have to do some special prepping?||||reg||5
Z||000004||cardealer||02-07-2001||07:35 PM||||used body shop rivets and then glassed in the scoop with regular dupont fiberglass stuff. after i cut the hole in wing for the l.e.d. i filled it up (the inside) with that sealant foam you buy in the can so the l.e.d. would have some type of backing. a little bondo and spot putty around the edges and that about it. i did all work at my friend body shop, he is now installing a new spray booth with drying heaters and better lighting so as soon as he is finished i will spray the entire car!!!<BR>here is a closer look :<BR> <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1515369&a=11450721&p=40336449&Sequence=0&res=high" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1515369&a=11450721&p=40336449&Sequence=0&res=high</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000005||mrfixit58||02-08-2001||10:43 AM||||cardealer,<P>I hope you removed the pop rivits after the fiberglass filler cured. I've installed a couple of scoops myself and the first time I did, I left the pop rivits in place and used filler over them. After a time, I started noticing dimples around the scoop where the rivits were. After a couple of years, the scoop started to split (it was ABS plastic) as well. <P>I talked to a bodyman who specialized in Corvette fiberglass work and he told me that the rivits or screws should always be removed once the fiberglass hardens, otherwise, as I saw on my hood, the will eventually show through.<P>Roy  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>||||reg||4
Z||000006||Joe4x4||02-08-2001||04:35 PM||||looks nice......I was thinking of doing something just like that but I was thinking <BR>about going all the way across the wing .<BR> Some of the new Cadillac`s have them on the top of the trunk.<P>I like it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Fiero got fire<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/exp.gif">          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/animated_cat.gif"> ||||reg||1
